## How Handoffs Work

1. User sends message to orchestrator
2. Orchestrator analyzes intent
3. If specialist needed, handoff occurs automatically
4. Specialist handles the conversation
5. Can hand back to orchestrator or to another specialist

## Adding New Specialists

1. Add to `specialists.py`:

```python
new_specialist_agent = Agent(
    name="New Specialist",
    instructions="Your expertise instructions...",
    handoff_description="When to transfer here",
)
```

2. Update `orchestrator.py` to include the new agent in handoffs.

